cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StepCheck, please cite the ICSOC 2026 paper below."
title: "StepCheck: Sound Static Verification of Deployed AWS Step Functions Workflows"
abstract: >-
  StepCheck is a static verifier for the deployed Amazon States Language (ASL)
  artifact. A flow-sensitive analysis of the ASL input/output pipeline reports a
  missing-field access as an error only when every execution reaching the read
  would fail under the modeled semantics; seven further checks cover structural,
  contract, ordering, retry, concurrency, temporal and compensation properties,
  each graded by the provenance of the facts behind it.
